{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行大号白色标题，随后容易被下方同样醒目的粗体文字和紫色强调词吸引。上下两块都具有很强的视觉权重。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定（隐约知道是在一段亲密关系中，但第一眼难以确定他具体面临什么处境）\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、犹疑、害怕受伤，隐约有害怕失去的感觉。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他从害怕自己的需要给对方添负担，转变为害怕对方不再需要自己；以及他想收回心意，却发现压抑真心反而更难受的完整心理关系。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块大号粗体文字都很显眼，争夺主视线，视觉入口不够集中。\",\n    \"单块文字较长，尤其下方段落包含害怕添负担、害怕不被需要、考虑隐藏心意、发现隐藏更难受等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块大字中，需要结合标题的持续性担忧和下方段落的具体心理原因才能理解。\",\n    \"紫色放大的词虽然醒目，但“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”单独看仍不足以说明具体处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3e076da0-2fea-442e-96b2-058dbb31f128", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012107252941Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:21:48.635876+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0d5ed95b934b6d749439ec3d0d5d816bf039b92b82472d547d816786c01c6ac0", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessi